    "data": "<h1 style=\"margin: 16px 0; font-size: 26px !important;\">Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"/></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"/></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A4jMzREkq/\" target=\"_blank\">静电干扰</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/093f79f7117fd673ab3ffdc5670f65553546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oC411572T/\" target=\"_blank\">死别</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cdf83836a76bddc46c63cfeff8e745755a5882de.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q2Nez2E71/\" target=\"_blank\">机机坏掉了</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a4030fc9cb73a9b864ce0de24ef541207e3f5423.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15J4m1A7qy/\" target=\"_blank\">催眠师</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c4496e1c95132a8dd859f9ad52d92a7e58efec75.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vqQUYYEmg/\" target=\"_blank\">超级超级超级超级超级讨厌</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/656b997a91205b33b9f1511343b4bc2f3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xQMqzQEhu/\" target=\"_blank\">外交大使</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/821e50784312c7a36a6e48065adbf57f3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13e7PztEGd/\" target=\"_blank\">回复还没好吗？大叔式发言！</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/944707b8963342b7ca9063b7068c15ea3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s1NvzTES4/\" target=\"_blank\">阴魂不散</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" co