false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/368f0a9fae9756fde41fd170f7372cb002359341.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 7 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rDMyzvEvg/\" target=\"_blank\">血娃娃</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ff1b2cfa27cee81029a06c09403c1d91ab253680.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 6 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1me73z6E4j/\" target=\"_blank\">我没有去那场烟火大会</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/58717c77a37b3ff3a6b315b502620a7ed792b310.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 5 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RHNvzXEL6/\" target=\"_blank\">V</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c4a82b57f0122ca8539a45ed91f0eebe3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 4 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1syMHz3Efc/\" target=\"_blank\">管他呢，孤注一掷吧！</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/056a8b20f338223ff4bca447953049673546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 3 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YfJJzVEDF/\" target=\"_blank\">武装乙女</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\"